---
/**
 * Starts the scroll reveal on the page (@hubpav/hwio-web-runtime/reveal). Render it once, in the layout
 * of pages that mark content with `data-hwio-reveal` (HWioSection `reveal`, HWioApplicationTile
 * `reveal`, a site's own markup). Renders nothing.
 *
 * Fail-safe: content waiting for its reveal hides only after this runtime has started; without it the
 * content simply shows. Each element fades in and settles once, the first time it enters the viewport;
 * `data-hwio-reveal-delay="<ms>"` staggers siblings. Under prefers-reduced-motion everything shows at once.
 */
---
<script>
  import { hwioRevealRuntime } from '@hubpav/hwio-web-runtime/reveal';
  hwioRevealRuntime();
</script>
